Z||000017||sqoach||03-23-2001||03:25 PM||||ok it isn't the tape. i thought it might have been, then i tried something. i can't believe i didn't try this yesterday. i just thought to try and ground the wire to the metal part of the fan switch. fan kicked on. so the fan switch is being grounded. i guess the switch is bad. i've let my car run idle for a long time, so it has to be getting hot enough to trigger the switch. ||||reg||1
